{
 "_readme": "Chat enquiry forms. Each field: key, label (en/kn), type (text|phone|email|choice|longtext), required, choices. triggers are phrases that open the form directly. kbActions maps a knowledge-base id to buttons shown under its answer. guides = 'ask me' flows: each node has a question (q) and tap-to-answer options (opts). An option's 'to' is a chip payload: '#guide:<node>' (next question), '#<kb id>', '#form:<id>', '#products-live', or plain text that is asked like a typed question. 'back' = node to return to.",
